{"replies_html": "\n\n\n  <div class=\"odd \">\n    <!-- Start email -->\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"email\">\n\n    <div id=\"UZPNPPDYL5APZLO573LFHXX2ZLPVLZDE\" class=\"email-header\">\n        <div class=\"gravatar-wrapper d-flex\">\n            <div class=\"gravatar circle\">\n                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"email-author d-flex\">\n                <h2 class=\"name\">\n                    \n                    <a class=\"aaa\" href=\"/archives/users/45b8e64d36354fb5b1e821ab1b997de3/\"\n                       title=\"See the profile for RunqingXu\"\n                       >RunqingXu</a>\n                    \n                </h2>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"email-date right\">\n            \n            \n            <span class=\"date d-none d-sm-inline\">\n                1 Oct\n                \n            </span>\n            <span class=\"date d-sm-none\">\n                1 Oct\n                \n            </span>\n            \n            <div class=\"time\">\n                <span title=\"Sender's time: Oct. 1, 2026, 6:41 p.m.\">6:41 p.m.</span>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n        \n    </div> <!-- /email-header: gravatar, author-info, date, peramlink, changed_subject -->\n\n    <div class=\"email-body \">\n      \n<style>\n.email-body .html-content,\n.email-body .html-content table,\n.email-body .html-content td,\n.email-body .html-content th,\n.email-body .html-content div,\n.email-body .html-content p,\n.email-body .html-content span {\n    white-space: normal;\n}\n.email-body .html-content table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin: 0.5em 0;\n    max-width: 100%;\n}\n.email-body .html-content td,\n.email-body .html-content th {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n}\n.email-body .html-content img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"html-content\"><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Dear all,</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">We are very grateful to Yamin Liu and Tianyuan Xie for privately bringing to our attention a typo in the specification, along with several inconsistencies between the specification and the implementation.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Overall, none of these issues affects the security or performance of our scheme. We have carefully reviewed and corrected all of them. A summary of the corrections is given below.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">### One Typo in the Specification</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">1. Correction to the NEV-C2 parameter specification. \u00a0</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">We corrected a typo in Table 2 for \\((\\chi_f,\\chi_g)=(B_1,\\cT_{1/8})\\) in NEV-C2. The correct setting is \\((\\chi_f,\\chi_g)=(\\cT_{1/8},B_1)\\). \u00a0</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The decryption-failure probability and the security estimates were already based on the correct parameter setting and therefore remain unchanged.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">### Corrections to the Implementation</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The following corrections were made to bring the implementation into full alignment with the specification.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">2. Added implicit rejection to the CCA-KEM/PKE implementation for the compressed parameter sets NEV-C1/2/3*.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">3. Added exact length checks for public keys, secret keys, and ciphertexts to the KEM wrappers; standardized explicit failure return codes; and ensured that output buffers and output lengths are cleared upon explicit failure.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">4. Aligned the H3 instantiation with the specification.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">5. Aligned the message decoder&#x27;s center value, centered modular reduction, and decision threshold with the specification.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">6. Moved the Pt2noise parity block to the final block, as specified, and adjusted the placement of the pseudorandom bytes accordingly.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">7. Changed key generation to sample \\(g\\) before \\(f\\), in accordance with the specification.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">8. Fixed out-of-bounds tail reads in the AVX2 ternary sampler and corrected memory-alignment handling for NTT constant tables and byte buffers.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">9. Eliminated undefined behavior caused by left-shifting negative signed integers in the REF polynomial inversion implementation.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">10. Added modular reduction of polynomial multiplication inputs and intermediate values to prevent overflow in REF-D3 ciphertext processing and to correct multiplication results in the affected REF and AVX2 parameter sets.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">11. Replaced the system random-number implementation to eliminate out-of-bounds writes.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">We sincerely appreciate the continued feedback and analysis from the community. Such feedback is invaluable in helping us improve the robustness of both the specification and its implementations. The latest implementation is attached for those interested in our scheme.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">We welcome further analysis, comments, and feedback from the community.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Thank you for your continued interest and support.</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Best regards, \u00a0</div><div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The NEV Team</div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"email-info\">\n      <div class=\"likeform-wrapper right\">\n        <div class=\"messagelink pull-right\">\n          <button class=\"toggle-font btn btn-sm\"\n                title=\"Display in fixed font\"\n                data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-placement=\"bottom\">\n                <i class=\"fa fa-font\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <a href=\"/archives/list/pkcforum@list.niccs.org.cn/message/UZPNPPDYL5APZLO573LFHXX2ZLPVLZDE/\"\n             title=\"Permalink for this message\"\n             data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-placement=\"bottom\"><i class=\"fa fa-link\"></i></a>\n        </div>\n        \n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Reply link -->\n        \n        \n        <a class=\"reply reply-mailto\" title=\"Reply\" href=\"#\">\n            <i class=\"fa fa-reply\"></i>\n            Reply\n        </a>\n        \n        \n\n        <!-- Attachments -->\n        \n        <div class=\"attachments dropdown\">\n            <a class=\"attachments\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"#\">\n                \n                1 attachment\n                \n                <span class=\"caret\"></span>\n            </a>\n            <ul class=\"attachments-list list-unstyled dropdown-menu\">\n            \n                <li><a href=\"/archives/list/pkcforum@list.niccs.org.cn/message/UZPNPPDYL5APZLO573LFHXX2ZLPVLZDE/attachment/4/NEV_Implementations.zip\"\n                        title=\"application/octet-stream, 1.9\u00a0MB\"\n                        >NEV_Implementations.zip\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n            \n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Reply form -->\n        \n        <div class=\"reply-form-unauthenticated\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"/accounts/login/?next=/archives/list/pkcforum%40list.niccs.org.cn/thread/7ZYN5QNIORSGBY3FNOE3DNCO43KZRVJA/replies#\">\n                Sign in to reply online\n            </a>\n        </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n    <!-- End of email -->\n  </div>\n\n\n", "more_pending": false, "next_offset": null}